{"id":"661464","name":"青红土豆片","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661464/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"青红辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"一小块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青红椒掰成小块。","img":"images/661464/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆切片，控干水。","img":"images/661464/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜丝葱花牛肉片。","img":"images/661464/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"两片葱花爆香，牛肉片翻炒。","img":"images/661464/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"变色，盛出来。","img":"images/661464/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次热锅，葱姜爆香。","img":"images/661464/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入土豆片翻炒。","img":"images/661464/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"土豆片变色后加入青红椒。","img":"images/661464/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"断生后加入蚝油盐生抽。","img":"images/661464/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻炒一下，加入炒好的牛肉。","img":"images/661464/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"香油，鸡精出锅。","img":"images/661464/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}